  "summaryEn": "Week 3 (Slides 1–40 Complete): Data Addressing Modes Basics (01/05), The Seven Data-Addressing Modes (02/05), Program Memory Addressing Modes (03/05), Stack Memory Addressing (04/05), and Putting It Together (05/05).",
